This project contains modifications to the Memories go-vod transcoder.
Upstream: https://github.com/pulsejet/memories
Baseline: v10.2.0 / d59c33d94d4e9627565e2023eb3c5c798788ebe2; go-vod protocol 0.6.3
The upstream go-vod Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

Hardware support comes from Rockchip MPP/RGA and the FFmpeg work shipped in
Jellyfin FFmpeg, including work from nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip.
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-ffmpeg
https://github.com/nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip
FFmpeg and bundled libraries retain their respective licenses. The runtime
retains the Jellyfin FFmpeg copyright file from its pinned base image.

The optional memories_rkmpp_player companion app is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. Its license is included in memories_rkmpp_player/LICENSE.
